WEBVTT

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.973
Welcome to the Velvet Room.

00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:14.471
Dear Guest, I see a lack of caution
in your demeanor.

00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:18.476
The fog is preparing to grow dense once more.

00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:21.384
Your ordeals are not yet over.

00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:23.420
No...

00:00:24.325 --> 00:00:28.989
In fact, they may grow
more unforgiving than before.

00:00:30.398 --> 00:00:33.561
But you still have a great deal of time left.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:37.159
You should proceed at your own pace.

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:42.207
This is becoming most fascinating...

00:01:07.068 --> 00:01:09.904
Hide and seek it wants to play again

00:01:09.904 --> 00:01:12.573
Like a detective, I won't let it get away

00:01:12.573 --> 00:01:15.443
It's constantly costuming with loads of fake

00:01:15.443 --> 00:01:17.611
I will strip search if I have to

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:21.015
No I'm not afraid to know it no, no, no

00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:22.917
I am so determined

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:26.587
To chase after what's hidden

00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:31.183
And seize this day this moment

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:34.762
Wanna know

00:01:34.762 --> 00:01:36.864
And I keep accelerate

00:01:36.864 --> 00:01:38.199
Wanna go

00:01:38.199 --> 00:01:41.100
Ignition turned on

00:01:41.302 --> 00:01:45.039
It's about the time to drive to truth

00:01:45.039 --> 00:01:45.906
Wanna seize

00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:47.875
Stranger than any movies

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:49.043
Wanna seize

00:01:49.043 --> 00:01:51.378
Ignorance is not bliss

00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:54.347
They say that truth will out

00:01:54.715 --> 00:01:56.817
Can't keep on hiding

00:01:56.817 --> 00:01:59.053
There's no turning back now

00:01:59.053 --> 00:02:00.454
I'm gonna go on

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:05.084
I'm gonna go get what I want

