the high school student and private detective

00:02:30.251 --> 00:02:35.422
who assisted with the case of serial murders in
Inaba where the bodies were found upside-down.

00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:35.456
Today's Special Feature:
who assisted with the case of serial murders in
